{"availability":"available","full":"rickintoplace/RickCV","name":"RickCV","description":"A dynamically customizable resume template in HTML and JS with automatic ATS support function ","category":"Productivity","language":"JavaScript","stars":1,"forks":1,"created":"2025-01-02T15:42:06Z","updated":"2026-10-06T10:13:08Z","license":"AGPL-3.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://rick-cv.vercel.app","topics":["cv","cv-template","lebenslauf","resume","resume-builder","resume-creator","resume-template"],"demo":"https://rick-cv.vercel.app/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T02:09:40.610Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T02:09:40.610Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T02:09:40.610Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T02:09:40.610Z","stars":1,"forks":1}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["RickCV is a browser-based builder for resumes and cover letters. Fill in a form, watch the document update live, save it as a PDF. No sign-up, no server, no build step: plain HTML, CSS and JavaScript, and everything you type stays on your own device — including what you show an applicant tracking system, which you can read and edit here rather than guess at.","About the last step in the picture: the import reads what is actually inside the file, without a language model. A PDF generated from text comes across nearly complete, pictures included; a scan or a heavily graphic template gives you a rough draft instead. RickCV shows what it read before it changes anything, and says when the result is only a draft — see what a PDF gives away.","RickCV used to embed a copy of your data behind the layout so applicant tracking systems would pick it up. That is no longer the default. Detectors treat invisible content as manipulation: text below 4 pt, text in the background colour, any mismatch between what a human sees and what a machine extracts. In a study of 196,682 real resumes, roughly 1 % carried hidden injected content — over 90 % of it plain hidden skill lists."],"features":["Visual editor with live preview — every part of the document is a form field; the page","next to it re-renders as you type.","Your own categories — Education, Experience and Volunteering are only defaults.","Rename, reorder, add; each keeps a machine-readable meaning, so applicant systems still file it correctly.","Themes are files — nine come with RickCV, and you can write your own in the builder,"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/rickintoplace/RickCV/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"ef787f34a647359ebf172893c1dab8f01dca4a36fdc337dcadf497c39d67711b","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T02:09:40.832Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T02:09:40.832Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"RickCV is a browser-based builder for resumes and cover letters. Fill in a form, watch the document update live, save it as a PDF. No sign-up, no server, no build step: plain HTML, CSS and JavaScript, and everything you type stays on your own device — including what you show an applicant tracking system, which you can read and edit here rather than guess at.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/rickintoplace/RickCV/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"ef787f34a647359ebf172893c1dab8f01dca4a36fdc337dcadf497c39d67711b","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/rickintoplace/RickCV/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T02:09:40.832Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-06T10:13:08Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/rickintoplace/RickCV/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T02:09:40.834Z","hash":"ef787f34a647359ebf172893c1dab8f01dca4a36fdc337dcadf497c39d67711b","originalBytes":28260,"storedBytes":28260,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["resume","one","document","tools","every","browser","file","tests","theme","builder","data","example","files","letter","open","pdf","rickcv","text","editor","node","only","page","themes","what","cover","documents","font","import","own","preview","